cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite both the software and the preregistration it belongs to."
title: "Prophage and anti-phage defence genomic pilot workflow"
abstract: >-
  Snakemake workflow and stratified genome selection for the calibration pilot
  of a comparative genomics study of prophages, prophage-encoded virulence
  determinants and anti-phage defence systems in West African Escherichia coli.
  Runs geNomad, an independent prophage predictor, CheckV at two flank lengths,
  DefenseFinder, CRISPRCasFinder, Bakta, CheckM2, seqkit and PopPUNK at
  parameters fixed in the registered protocol, and returns the observed
  prophage count distribution and negative binomial dispersion.
type: software
